{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":488056,"name":"Steve Solomon","username":"Steve_Solomon","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/e9a140/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-10T09:38:13.671Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488056-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488056-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488056-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488056-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhere does the bug appear?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot (mobile app)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nEvery message to my bot “Sivraj” fails with:\u003cbr\u003e\n\"Bot failed to respond\u003cbr\u003e\nSomething went wrong while generating the reply.\u003cbr\u003e\nThis has been happening for several days. Even s\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWhat I already tried\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eForce-closed and reopened the app multiple tim\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTried again over several days\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdating the app\u003cbr\u003e\n**Please recover/rebuild the Agent Computer on t\u003cbr\u003e\nMy bots, chats, and files should still be safe.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlatform\u003c/strong\u003e: iOS (or Android)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eApproximate start\u003c/strong\u003e: [e.g. a few days ago]\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488056-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488056-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhere does the bug appear?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot (mobile app)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nEvery message to my bot “Sivraj” fails with:\u003cbr\u003e\n\"Bot failed to respond\u003cbr\u003e\nSomething went wrong while generating the reply.\u003cbr\u003e\nThis has been happening for several days. Even s\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWhat I already tried\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eForce-closed and reopened the app multiple tim\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTried again over several days\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdating the app\u003cbr\u003e\n**Please recover/rebuild the Agent Computer on t\u003cbr\u003e\nMy bots, chats, and files should still be safe.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlatform\u003c/strong\u003e: iOS (or Android)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eApproximate start\u003c/strong\u003e: [e.g. a few days ago]\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488056-screenshots-screen-recordings-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488056-screenshots-screen-recordings-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/9/5963f9c71b4a4cecfbe212c1dcef91ff6d72479b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/cKMGTj36ODEOJ5OXEvda9zU9LMD.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"IMG_0464.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/9/5963f9c71b4a4cecfbe212c1dcef91ff6d72479b_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_0464.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"cKMGTj36ODEOJ5OXEvda9zU9LMD\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/9/5963f9c71b4a4cecfbe212c1dcef91ff6d72479b_2_230x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/9/5963f9c71b4a4cecfbe212c1dcef91ff6d72479b_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discour